<title>SINGAPORE: Datacraft in Memotec deal.</title>
<headline>Datacraft in Memotec deal.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's communications and network systems integrator Datacraft Asia Ltd said on Monday it had signed a deal to market, distribute and support Memotec Communications Inc's frame relay products.</p>
<p>Datacraft said in a statement it had a three-year agreement to sell the products in Asia, including New Zealand and China.</p>
<p>The products are targetted at medium and large corporations and telecoms service providers for use on networks.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
